ages.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sckg32.jpg"}], "slug": "a-plague-tale-bundle", "storyline": "A Plague Tale: Innocence\n1348. The plague ravages the Kingdom of France. Amicia and her younger brother Hugo are pursued by the Inquisition through villages devastated by the disease. Aided only by the link that binds their fates together, they will face untold horrors in their struggle to survive. As their adventure begins\u2026 the time of innocence ends.\n\nA Plague Tale: Requiem\nAfter escaping their devastated homeland, Amicia and Hugo travel far south, to new regions and vibrant cities. There, they attempt to start a new life and control Hugo\u2019s curse. But, when Hugo\u2019s powers reawaken, death and destruction return in a flood of devouring rats. Forced to flee once more, the siblings place their hopes on a prophesized island that may hold the key to saving Hugo.", "summary": "A Plague Tale Bundle includes the entirety of Amicia and Hugo\u2019s heartrending journey through history's darkest hours with the two acclaimed games A Plague Tale: Innocence and its sequel A Plague Tale: Requiem.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 17, "name": "Fantasy"}, {"id": 22, "name": "Historical"}, {"id": 23, "name": "Stealth"}, {"id": 31, "name": "Drama"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/a-plague-tale-bundle", "videos": [{"id": 82112, "name": "Launch Trailer", "video_id": "lGy0Ef-hBNY", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=lGy0Ef-hBNY", "title": "A Plague Tale: Innocence - Launch Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/lGy0Ef-hBNY/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 82113, "name": "Launch Trailer", "video_id": "n7vZqU9G9ZI", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=n7vZqU9G9ZI", "title": "A Plague Tale: Requiem | Launch Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/n7vZqU9G9ZI/maxresdefault.jpg"}]}